1t8u|n|Any of the smaller species of the genus Lepus, especially the common European species (Lepus cuniculus), which is often kept as a pet, and has been introduced into many countries. It is remarkably prolific, and has become a pest in some parts of Australia and New Zealand.	v:1vkx,1,2~1vkx,1,2	V:118l,58,1~118l,58,1	n:nzn,23,2;1vkx,17,6~1vkx,17,6;nzn,23,2	N:118k,116,65;118l,115,51~118k,116,65;118l,115,51
